   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Walk the imports tree starting from AppModule:  DBModule -> UsersModule -> OrdersModule\n2. For each module build its SCOPE  =  own providers  +  exports of every imported module\n     UsersModule scope:  UsersRepository, UsersService, PasswordHasher, PrismaService\n     OrdersModule scope: OrdersService, UsersService   (PasswordHasher & PrismaService are NOT here)\n3. Read each constructor's parameter types (the tokens) and look them up in that module's scope\n4. Create instances dependencies-first, once each (singleton):\n     PrismaService -> UsersRepository + PasswordHasher -> UsersService -> OrdersService\n5. Token not in scope?  ->  \"Nest can't resolve dependencies of the OrdersService (UsersService, ?)\"",
   "originalText": "1. Walk the imports tree starting from AppModule:  DBModule -> UsersModule -> OrdersModule\n2. For each module build its SCOPE  =  own providers  +  exports of every imported module\n     UsersModule scope:  UsersRepository, UsersService, PasswordHasher, PrismaService\n     OrdersModule scope: OrdersService, UsersService   (PasswordHasher & PrismaService are NOT here)\n3. Read each constructor's parameter types (the tokens) and look them up in that module's scope\n4. Create instances dependencies-first, once each (singleton):\n     PrismaService -> UsersRepository + PasswordHasher -> UsersService -> OrdersService\n5. Token not in scope?  ->  \"Nest can't resolve dependencies of the OrdersService (UsersService, ?)\"",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
